    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap Fixed-Point Mel-Frequency Cepstral Coefficients (MFCC) Extractor. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extracts 13 Mel-Frequency Cepstral Coefficients (MFCC) from raw 16-bit PCM audio using fixed-point Q15 arithmetic for microcontrollers running keyword spotting (KWS) and acoustic anomaly detection with syn_nn. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
